 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Slash, Shoot, Roll</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Phantom Relics</i></strong> is a fast-paced isometric slasher with real-time combat, deadly traps, and explosive action. Dive into ancient catacombs alone or with a friend in local co-op and stop the awakening of evil by battling through hordes of undead and powerful bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126620/extras/65a1b70e99565593a47a75f13544bc8b.webp?t=1772536991\" width=616 height=43 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore, Find, Think</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In search of powerful relics that may save the world, you\u2019ll not only fight enemies but also solve puzzles, avoid traps, and explore the dark corners of the dungeons. But remember \u2014 each boss has its unique attacks and requires a special approach to strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126620/extras/6e31ee1680035414208794093033a31e.poster.avif?t=1772536991\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126620/extras/6e31ee1680035414208794093033a31e.webm?t=1772536991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126620/extras/6e31ee1680035414208794093033a31e.mp4?t=1772536991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>What Awaits You</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Brutal Combat</strong> \u2014 Chain combos, parry enemy strikes, and unleash powerful ultimate attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Firearms</strong> \u2014 Shoot with a shotgun or pistol; each character has their own unique weapon style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Traps and Explosions</strong> \u2014 Avoid deadly traps, use explosive barrels, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Local Co-op</strong> \u2014 Team up in local co-op on a single screen (<i><strong>or Remote Play Together</strong></i>). Two heroes \u2014 one cursed dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Powerful Relics</strong> \u2014 Collect 15+ unique artifacts that change your playstyle and unlock new combat abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Epic Bosses</strong> \u2014 Fight powerful bosses, each with its own attacks and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Dark Fantasy Atmosphere</strong> \u2014 Explore eerie catacombs, uncover secrets, and battle waves of undead, knights, and mutants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126620/extras/65a1b70e99565593a47a75f13544bc8b.webp?t=1772536991\" width=616 height=43 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHO IS THIS FOR?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2192 <strong>Fans of slashers</strong></i> where reaction and tactics matter. Prove that you're unbeatable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2192 <strong>Explorers</strong></i> \u2013 dive into a dark fantasy atmosphere and uncover the secrets of the catacombs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2192 <strong>Co-op maniacs</strong></i> \u2013 together, crush mobs, struggle with puzzles, share potions\u2026 and scream at each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Dex Games Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG